   "seed": 1025048755,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1264699954,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1792234710332,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Blog platform (posts & comments)\nstack: Go (grpc-go, grpc-gateway, pgx), PostgreSQL, Redis, S3 + CDN, Kubernetes\n\nFR:\n1. user can create / edit / delete a post (title, text, tags)\n2. anyone can read a post with like and comment counts\n3. user can see a feed: latest posts, by tag, by author\n4. user can comment on a post and reply to a comment\n5. user can like / unlike a post\n\nNFRs:\n1. 20M DAU, 10 post views + 5 feed pages per user per day, peak = 3x avg\n2. ~20K read RPS and ~500 write RPS at peak (read heavy)\n3. latency p99: read post < 100ms, feed < 200ms, write < 300ms\n4. availability 99.95%, posts and comments are never lost\n5. counters and feeds may lag up to ~1 min (eventual consistency)\n6. keep data for 5+ years",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Blog platform (posts & comments)\nstack: Go (grpc-go, grpc-gateway, pgx), PostgreSQL, Redis, S3 + CDN, Kubernetes\n\nFR:\n1. user can create / edit / delete a post (title, text, tags)\n2. anyone can read a post with like and comment counts\n3. user can see a feed: latest posts, by tag, by author\n4. user can comment on a post and reply to a comment\n5. user can like / unlike a post\n\nNFRs:\n1. 20M DAU, 10 post views + 5 feed pages per user per day, peak = 3x avg\n2. ~20K read RPS and ~500 write RPS at peak (read heavy)\n3. latency p99: read post < 100ms, feed < 200ms, write < 300ms\n4. availability 99.95%, posts and comments are never lost\n5. counters and feeds may lag up to ~1 min (eventual consistency)\n6. keep data for 5+ years",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "WPdAaVB6bHKLNNusLMIF",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 950.639404296875,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 590.51953125,
   "height": 700,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a1",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1320793674,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 739589441,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1792234710332,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "capacity estimates\n\nreads per day\n20M x (10 posts + 10 comment pages + 5 feeds) = 500M\n500M / 86400 = ~6K RPS avg -> x3 = ~18K peak (~20K)\n\nwrites per day\nposts 200K + comments 2M + likes 10M = ~12M\n12M / 86400 = ~150 RPS avg -> x3 = ~450 peak (~500)\n\nread : write = 40 : 1 -> cache as much as we can\n\nstorage per day\npost 5KB x 200K = 1GB\ncomment 0.5KB x 2M = 1GB\nlike 100B x 10M = 1GB\n= 3GB/day -> ~1TB/year -> ~5.5TB in 5 years (x3 replicas)\nimages -> S3 + CDN, not in the DB\n\nhot data (Redis)\nposts of the last 7 days: 1.5M x 12KB = ~18GB\n+ first comment pages ~8GB -> ~30GB Redis cluster\n\nservers\nCDN serves ~60% of reads -> ~8K RPS reach the services\nGo pod ~2K RPS (cached reads) -> need 4 pods,\nrun 6 per service (2 per AZ): enough after losing 1 AZ\n1 PG primary easily handles 500 write RPS",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "capacity estimates\n\nreads per day\n20M x (10 posts + 10 comment pages + 5 feeds) = 500M\n500M / 86400 = ~6K RPS avg -> x3 = ~18K peak (~20K)\n\nwrites per day\nposts 200K + comments 2M + likes 10M = ~12M\n12M / 86400 = ~150 RPS avg -> x3 = ~450 peak (~500)\n\nread : write = 40 : 1 -> cache as much as we can\n\nstorage per day\npost 5KB x 200K = 1GB\ncomment 0.5KB x 2M = 1GB\nlike 100B x 10M = 1GB\n= 3GB/day -> ~1TB/year -> ~5.5TB in 5 years (x3 replicas)\nimages -> S3 + CDN, not in the DB\n\nhot data (Redis)\nposts of the last 7 days: 1.5M x 12KB = ~18GB\n+ first comment pages ~8GB -> ~30GB Redis cluster\n\nservers\nCDN serves ~60% of reads -> ~8K RPS reach the services\nGo pod ~2K RPS (cached reads) -> need 4 pods,\nrun 6 per service (2 per AZ): enough after losing 1 AZ\n1 PG primary easily handles 500 write RPS",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "qHl1fTBDEGbLMNmW8JLM",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1691.158935546875,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 427.5596923828125,
   "height": 900,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
