   "updated": 1792234710332,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "user\n- id\n- username\n- created_at\n\npost\n- id (snowflake, sorted by time)\n- author_id, author_name\n- title\n- body\n- tags []\n- status\n- like_count\n- comment_count\n- version (optimistic lock)\n- idempotency_key (unique)\n- created_at, updated_at\n\ncomment\n- id\n- post_id\n- parent_id (null = top level)\n- author_id, author_name\n- body\n- idempotency_key (unique)\n- created_at\n\nlike\n- post_id\n- user_id\nPK (post_id, user_id) -> 1 like per user\n\nposts DB (PostgreSQL): user, post, like\ncomments DB (PostgreSQL): comment\nindex post (author_id, id), GIN (tags)\nindex comment (post_id, id) -> cursor pages",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "user\n- id\n- username\n- created_at\n\npost\n- id (snowflake, sorted by time)\n- author_id, author_name\n- title\n- body\n- tags []\n- status\n- like_count\n- comment_count\n- version (optimistic lock)\n- idempotency_key (unique)\n- created_at, updated_at\n\ncomment\n- id\n- post_id\n- parent_id (null = top level)\n- author_id, author_name\n- body\n- idempotency_key (unique)\n- created_at\n\nlike\n- post_id\n- user_id\nPK (post_id, user_id) -> 1 like per user\n\nposts DB (PostgreSQL): user, post, like\ncomments DB (PostgreSQL): comment\nindex post (author_id, id), GIN (tags)\nindex comment (post_id, id) -> cursor pages",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "O5tCYmsSbFmBCJaJ5u4J",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2268.7186279296875,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 767.51953125,
   "height": 675,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
