  {
   "id": "srsrZ93NoydoCoxOEQ5T",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2268.7186279296875,
   "y": 825,
   "width": 543.7396240234375,
   "height": 275,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "ak",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 319898647,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 939280506,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1792234710332,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "read post\n1. CDN hit -> return\n2. GW -> post service -> Redis hit -> return\n3. miss -> PG replica -> SET Redis -> return\n\nwrite comment\n1. GW: check JWT, rate limit\n2. comment service: INSERT comment\n   (idempotency_key is unique -> no duplicates on retry)\n3. INCR post:{id}:comments in Redis\n4. DEL comments:{post_id} cache",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "read post\n1. CDN hit -> return\n2. GW -> post service -> Redis hit -> return\n3. miss -> PG replica -> SET Redis -> return\n\nwrite comment\n1. GW: check JWT, rate limit\n2. comment service: INSERT comment\n   (idempotency_key is unique -> no duplicates on retry)\n3. INCR post:{id}:comments in Redis\n4. DEL comments:{post_id} cache",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "vQNjmZ15o3XfhMZo3fhg",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2268.7186279296875,
   "y": 1180,
   "width": 580.4395751953125,
   "height": 150,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "al",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1651524489,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1282391846,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1792234710332,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "scaling\n- horizontal: Go services are stateless (JWT),\n  N pods behind LB, autoscale by CPU\n- reads: CDN -> Redis -> PG read replicas\n- writes: 1 PG primary per DB is enough (~500 RPS)\n- later (~2TB): shard comments and likes by hash(post_id)",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "scaling\n- horizontal: Go services are stateless (JWT),\n  N pods behind LB, autoscale by CPU\n- reads: CDN -> Redis -> PG read replicas\n- writes: 1 PG primary per DB is enough (~500 RPS)\n- later (~2TB): shard comments and likes by hash(post_id)",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "j4cVYwGSasJHKlYgjBLo",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2268.7186279296875,
   "y": 1410,
   "width": 685.1995239257812,
   "height": 175,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "am",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1192891147,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 988852941,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1792234710332,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "caching (Redis, cache-aside)\n- post:{id} -> post, TTL 1h, DEL on update / delete\n- comments:{post_id} -> first page, TTL 30s\n- feed:{tag} -> sorted set of latest 1000 post ids\n- counters -> INCR delta in Redis, worker adds it to PG every 5s\n- CDN caches GET post / feed 30-60s, comments 5s, purge on delete\n- hot post -> in-memory cache 1s + singleflight",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "caching (Redis, cache-aside)\n- post:{id} -> post, TTL 1h, DEL on update / delete\n- comments:{post_id} -> first page, TTL 30s\n- feed:{tag} -> sorted set of latest 1000 post ids\n- counters -> INCR delta in Redis, worker adds it to PG every 5s\n- CDN caches GET post / feed 30-60s, comments 5s, purge on delete\n- hot post -> in-memory cache 1s + singleflight",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "mz795vj8B4dsF7M26L1v",
