   "text": "failure modes\n1. viral post (hot key) -> CDN + in-memory cache + singleflight\n2. cache stampede -> singleflight, TTL jitter\n3. Redis down -> read from PG replicas, rate limit at GW\n4. PG primary down -> Patroni failover ~30s, writes get 503,\n   client retries with the same idempotency_key\n5. replica lag -> author reads own writes from primary\n6. Redis loses counters -> recount from like / comment tables\n7. slow DB -> timeouts + circuit breaker,\n   show the post without comments",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "failure modes\n1. viral post (hot key) -> CDN + in-memory cache + singleflight\n2. cache stampede -> singleflight, TTL jitter\n3. Redis down -> read from PG replicas, rate limit at GW\n4. PG primary down -> Patroni failover ~30s, writes get 503,\n   client retries with the same idempotency_key\n5. replica lag -> author reads own writes from primary\n6. Redis loses counters -> recount from like / comment tables\n7. slow DB -> timeouts + circuit breaker,\n   show the post without comments",
